### Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks


### Create task
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test missing status",
  "priority": "medium"
}

###

POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Frontend POST test",
  "description": "Testing POST from frontend flow",
  "priority": "high",
  "status": "todo"
}


### Move task to non-empty done
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/546b6c3e-14e0-4f39-b749-b3feba9a8631
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test due date",
  "priority": "medium",
  "status": "done"
}


### Update task
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/782196d8-1e2f-4ec7-99fc-7a0e8f2ffabd
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "AB",
  "priority": "high",
  "status": "in-progress"
}


### Delete task
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/ТУТ_ID_ЗАДАЧИ


### Create task — invalid title
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test status",
  "priority": "medium",
  "status": "something"
}


### Create task — empty title
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "priority": "medium",
  "status": "todo"
}


###Update task positions
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/positions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "376236c9-34a8-44f2-9cc8-22b5a84d7723",
      "status": "done",
      "position": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "546b6c3e-14e0-4f39-b749-b3feba9a8631",
      "status": "done",
      "position": 0
    }
  ]
}